[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物を発見。\n総員、警戒",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster detected. Everyone, stay alert."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "急に曇ったと思ったら、なんだこいつ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought it was just the clouds, but what is that thing?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしかして、私たちの踊りにつられて……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you think it was drawn here by our dancing...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んなわけあるかい！\n……え？\u3000いや、ないよね！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no way that's it! ...Right? That can't be right?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "近海で巨大な魔物が確認されたという噂を聞いた。\nその魔物と特徴が一致している",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard rumors of a large monster being spotted offshore. The description matches."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしかしたらこいつも、行楽を楽しみに\nこの島へ来たのかもしれんぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps it too came to this island in search of leisure and good cheer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうでしたら、なんだか、かわいいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that's the case... that's rather endearing, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グアァアアアッ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "GRAAAAHH!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おのれっ！！\u3000慈悲は与えんぞ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Insolent beast!! I shall show no mercy!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ、ヤドヴィガ……どうする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp, Jadwiga... what do we do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "島は魔物を警戒し、多くの警備隊を導入している。\n彼らがいずれここに来て対処すると思われる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The island is on high alert. Many security forces have been deployed. They will likely arrive here shortly to handle the situation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの魔物は、特別危険というわけではない……が、\n広範囲に攻撃してくるため、ここにいるのは危険",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The monster is not especially dangerous... however, its attacks cover a wide area. Remaining here is not safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そっか。\nじゃあアタシたちはいったん退避すればいいのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-right. So we should just fall back for now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ベップ。あいつ、アタシたちで倒そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Bepp. Let's take it down ourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった。戦えるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. I'm ready to fight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜ……？\u3000もう間もなく警備隊が来る――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why...? The security forces will arrive soon—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、そうなんだけどさ。\nここには守りたいものがあるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I know. But there's something here I want to protect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネさんのために用意したこの場所を守りたい。\nあいつに壊されてたまるか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to protect this place we set up for Janne. I'm not letting that thing wreck it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたちみんなで、絶対に絶対に\n最高の休暇を過ごしてやるんだーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All of us together are going to have the absolute best vacation ever—no matter what!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様とヤンネさんの笑顔のため、\n邪魔はさせない……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For Alvina's and Janne's smiles... I won't let anything get in the way...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私が交戦する必要はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I have no obligation to engage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "加勢する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will fight with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤド……！\u3000助かるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga...! Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この場所を守るため、一緒に戦おう！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To protect this place—let's fight together!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]